    'If you want a simple one-month frame right away, this is most often positioned as 3 x Forever Aloe Vera Gel™ and 1 box of Forever Arctic Sea, plus 1 x Forever Aloe Liquid Soap, 1 x Forever Aloe First Spray and 1 x Aloe Propolis Creme for the outer routine.' => 'Ako odmah želiš jednostavan okvir za jedan mjesec, najčešće se predlažu 3 x Forever Aloe Vera Gel™ i 1 kutija Forever Arctic Sea, uz 1 x Forever Aloe Liquid Soap, 1 x Forever Aloe First Spray i 1 x Aloe Propolis Creme za spoljašnju njegu.',
