    'If you want a one-month frame, this is most often positioned as 3 x Forever Aloe Vera Gel™, 1 x Forever Marine Collagen, 1 x Mask Powder and 1 x Aloe Activator.' => 'Ako želiš okvir za jedan mjesec, najčešće se predlaže 3 x Forever Aloe Vera Gel™, 1 x Forever Marine Collagen, 1 x Mask Powder i 1 x Aloe Activator.',
