    'When the focus is food reactions, the answer should stay on an aloe base plus a probiotic direction without adding bee-based products while the reaction is active.' => 'Kada je fokus na reakcijama na hranu, odgovor treba da ostane usmjeren na bazu aloe i probiotik, bez dodavanja proizvoda na bazi pčelinjih sastojaka dok je reakcija aktivna.',
