    'Assistant style: "If the goal is a gentler digestive routine, a reasonable first direction is aloe vera and fiber-based support. I would keep it simple, start with one main direction, and only add support if it clearly fits your dog’s everyday routine."' => 'Stil asistenta: „Ako je cilj blaža rutina za varenje, razuman prvi pravac je podrška na bazi aloe vere i vlakana. Pojednostavio bih, počeo s jednim glavnim pravcem i dodao podršku samo ako se jasno uklapa u svakodnevnu rutinu tvog psa.“',
