    'For heartburn and reflux, the recommendation should stay calm and simple: aloe vera as the base, with probiotic support as the routine add-on.' => 'Kod gorušice i refluksa preporuka treba da bude smirena i jednostavna: aloe vera kao osnova, uz probiotičku podršku kao dodatak rutini.',
