    'Hello {{NAME}},<br /><br />We were unable to recover payment for your {{PLAN_NAME}} plan during the retry window, so future automatic renewals have now been turned off.<br /><br />Downgraded at: {{REVOKED_AT}}<br />Reason: {{FAILURE_REASON}}<br />Current fallback plan: {{FALLBACK_PLAN_NAME}}<br /><br />To activate PRO again, start a new subscription here: <a href="{{USER_PLAN_LINK}}">{{USER_PLAN_LINK}}</a>' => 'Zdravo {{NAME}},<br /><br />Nijesmo uspjeli da naplatimo tvoj plan {{PLAN_NAME}} tokom perioda za ponovni pokušaj, pa su buduća automatska obnavljanja sada isključena.<br /><br />Vraćanje na niži plan: {{REVOKED_AT}}<br />Razlog: {{FAILURE_REASON}}<br />Trenutni rezervni plan: {{FALLBACK_PLAN_NAME}}<br /><br />Da ponovo aktiviraš PRO, započni novu pretplatu ovdje: <a href="{{USER_PLAN_LINK}}">{{USER_PLAN_LINK}}</a>',
