    'Vitamini A, E i C – hranjiva podrška' => 'Vitamini A, E i C, hranljiva podrška',
    'Hello, <strong>{{NAME}}</strong>,<br /><br />This is a simple email to remind you that your account is going to be deleted in {{DAYS_UNTIL_DELETION}} days because your account has been inactive.<br /><br />If you wish to cancel this deletion, simply login with your account and the deletion process will be stopped.<br /><br /><a href="{{LOGIN_LINK}}">Login & stop deletion</a><br /><br />Regards,<br />The {{WEBSITE_TITLE}} team.' => 'Zdravo, <strong>{{NAME}}</strong>,<br /><br />Ovo je kratka poruka kao podsjetnik da će tvoj nalog biti obrisan za {{DAYS_UNTIL_DELETION}} dana jer je bio neaktivan.<br /><br />Ako želiš da otkažeš brisanje, samo se prijavi na svoj nalog i postupak brisanja će biti zaustavljen.<br /><br /><a href="{{LOGIN_LINK}}">Prijavi se i zaustavi brisanje</a><br /><br />Srdačan pozdrav,<br />Tim {{WEBSITE_TITLE}}.',
