    'If you want a one-month frame, this is most often positioned as 3 x Forever Aloe Vera Gel™ and 1 box of Forever Arctic Sea.' => 'Ako želite okvir za jedan mjesec, najčešće se predlažu 3 x Forever Aloe Vera Gel™ i 1 kutija Forever Arctic Sea.',
