    'The collaborator actively uses Coach, but the work still is not turning into visible lead or follow-up signal.' => 'Saradnik aktivno koristi Coach, ali rad još uvijek ne daje vidljiv signal o potencijalnim klijentima ili praćenju kontakata.',
