    'Mini Touch of Forever combines personal care products in one pack. It is a smaller selection than the large A Touch of Forever pack, not a sample set.' => 'Mini Touch of Forever objedinjuje proizvode za ličnu njegu u jednom pakovanju. To je manji izbor proizvoda od velikog pakovanja A Touch of Forever, a ne set uzoraka.',
