    'When the focus is hair, skin and nails, the recommendation should start from the inside through collagen and then, if useful, add precise topical hair care.' => 'Kada su u fokusu kosa, koža i nokti, preporuka treba da krene iznutra kroz kolagen, a zatim, ako je korisno, da doda ciljanu njegu kose spolja.',
