    'Activity, easy steps and challenging steps are counted by FCC account and compare the selected window with the immediately preceding window of the same length. For enrolled, started and completed, the large number is the permanent total, while the change compares new events in those two equal windows. Monthly Personal CC and both 4 CC indicators are deduplicated by Forever ID and count only the current FLP structure. Official 4 CC counts confirmed FLP360 signals; effective 4 CC uses the official 1/0 and, only when that signal is missing, the fallback formula of Personal CC ≥ 1 and inclusive Total Active CC ≥ 4.' => 'Aktivnost, jednostavni koraci i izazovni koraci broje se po FCC nalogu i porede izabrani period s neposredno prethodnim periodom iste dužine. Za upisane, započete i završene, veliki broj predstavlja ukupan broj od početka, dok se promjena poredi prema novim događajima u ta dva jednaka perioda. Mjesečni Personal CC i oba pokazatelja 4 CC deduplikuju se prema Forever ID-u i obuhvataju samo trenutnu FLP strukturu. Zvanični broj 4 CC potvrđuje signale FLP360, dok efektivni 4 CC koristi zvaničnu vrijednost 1/0, a samo kada taj signal nedostaje, zamjensku formulu Personal CC ≥ 1 i ukupni aktivni CC, uključujući graničnu vrijednost, ≥ 4.',
    'These are separate indicators, not steps in one conversion funnel: structure and qualified count unique Forever IDs, FCC connected counts active accounts in the current structure, enrolled and started count participants by account, and active refers to the selected time window. An approved shared Forever ID is not an error and does not merge account progress.' => 'Ovo su odvojeni pokazatelji, a ne koraci u jednom prodajnom toku: struktura i kvalifikovani broj predstavljaju jedinstvene Forever ID-jeve, FCC povezani broj obuhvata aktivne naloge u trenutnoj strukturi, upisani i započeti obuhvataju učesnike prema nalogu, a aktivni se odnosi na izabrani vremenski period. Odobreni zajednički Forever ID nije greška i ne spaja napredak naloga.',
    'Temporary FCC personal CC sum: not official Global Total CC' => 'Privremeni zbir ličnog CC u FCC-u: nije zvanični Global Total CC',
